WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.400
SCP-096 VS SCP-3802. Could this&nbsp;
infamously self-conscious baldy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.880
be brought down by a little hare growth by&nbsp;
dado? Let’s hop on over and take a look.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.120
When placed onto an adult, hare growth&nbsp;
by dado causes horrifically painful and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.760
typically fatal tumorous mutations that&nbsp;
turn into large rabbits and hop away.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:25.600
While this may harm SCP-096, we think it would&nbsp;
be unlikely to kill it, given the level of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.400
damage he’s been able to survive before. In all&nbsp;
likelihood, he would enter his rage state when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.080
the rabbits saw his face, regenerate, and kill&nbsp;
them all. Sorry, rabbit lovers and 096 haters.

